  "details": "I had an idea where a player could spawn different kinds of lights. This will help create amazing VR Photography. The lights could perhaps be located in the camera type menu. Each light can have a series of properties such as: color, intensity, enable glow (which shows the light in the screenshot photo), distance, disable shadows, and remove light. The kinds of lights that can be spawned are: Point lights, spot lights, and area lights. A player can spawn perhaps 6 lights which are only local to the player. The player can easily disable all lights by pressing the lights button again.",
